  "title": "Bitcoin: Add Magic Number for Testnet4",
  "description": "A few weeks ago, Bitcoin Core gained support for a new testnet: Testnet4. This commit adds testnet4's magic number to the bitcoin protocol dissector so wireshark can identify its messages.\n\ncf. https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/7590e93bc73b3bbac641f05d490fd5c984156b33/src/kernel/chainparams.cpp#L346-L349\n\nSupersedes !18258 and uses a branch name that is not `master`.",
